    "note": "A source that reports Apple HR coverage as sampled-minute density (12/60 = 0.2 at 5-minute cadence) would still abstain under coverage >= 0.5. This evidence supports the rule above, stated in that source's own denominator; it does not license relabelling one coverage as the other.",
